{"server":"cn","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_05_end","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_05","title":"“致新生活”","storyCode":"PV-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"1364f502acffc338f95774e675cfd8547ab784d704869056e86061b37fcaf65d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"柳德米拉留在了卡车互助会，渐渐融入了卡车司机们的生活。车祸当晚，索默尔避开了其他司机私自出车，察觉到蹊跷的柳德米拉主动坐上了副驾驶座。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g9_truckcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，这是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道！我正开车呢，发动机出了故障，结果发现这个人就躺在路边。吓我一跳，我还以为是我撞到了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这孩子一个人晕倒在荒野上，嘴里还一直念叨着要找一个穿红色连帽衫的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想总不能把她扔在那，就先带她回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找我？可我完全不认识她啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她看上去就是个孤零零的倒霉蛋，或许能留她在营地？我们最近忙成这样，补充一个人手也行啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"索默尔，你明知道互助会的每一个成员都是要经过严格审查的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像她这样的感染......来历不明的人，万一和家族有什么关系怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生说她情况还算稳定，等她醒来后，就让她离开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个倒霉蛋，怎么还紧紧握着刀不放，多危险啊。先给她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别碰我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿红色连帽衫的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿红色连帽衫的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉看着眼前的人，很用力地揉了揉眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......这是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿红色连帽衫的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是新沃尔西尼，卡车互助会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"是你们救了我......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿红色连帽衫的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我们的成员不会对一个晕倒在荒野上的人见死不救。但后面的事，我们没有办法帮你太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穿红色连帽衫的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们最多招待你一顿饭，之后就离开吧。索默尔，你来负责这件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们的帮助......我这就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保险起见，我还是想问问你......你不是家族的人，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经很多年没有听说过这个词了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得，你看上去也不像和那帮人有什么往来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别在意，伊雷妮只是很担心家族的人会渗入互助会，她要操心的事很多，并不是对你有什么敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来到营地后的医药费，其实全都是她自掏腰包的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......我明白，我不会给你们添麻烦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是需要花时间想想......接下来该做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会开车吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"在乌萨斯开过卡车，算吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesbedroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"红。\n很轻的呢喃，和声音同时出现的，是同样温柔的抚摸。\n像是飘落在草地上的树叶，在荒野的背坡处感受到的风，没有危险。\n她曾经在这样的呢喃和抚摸中睡去，长大。\n在罗德岛，没有人敢对她这样，没有人会对她这样，哪怕是凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......是外婆？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆，你已经完全看不清东西了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆说过的，外婆的双目被狼吞吃了，这副眼镜只是摆设。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有剜出狼的双目，将它们重新放回外婆的眼眶，外婆才能看清红的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆也没法抱抱红？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆的双手被狼吞下肚，你要斩断狼的四肢，把双手还给外婆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆也没法再教我唱歌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆也想继续教红唱歌。可狼总在嚎叫，外婆不敢惊到他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆，你为什么这么久才来找红？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼太多了，红，他们潜伏在路的两侧。你要割开狼的皮肉，用它们为外婆做一件衣衫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆真的会消失吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乖孩子，这就要看你能不能帮到外婆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红、红在龙门找到了狼，假的。但她身上有真狼的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"在那以后，红还没有新的发现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，外婆，是红没有继续找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆不会怪红。红是最乖最好的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红不是。红在第一次猎狼的时候就晕倒了，红当时太弱小，凯尔希在草窠里救了红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红暂时跟在她身边，她告诉红很多红不知道的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"什么是“保护”，什么是“行凶”？什么是“痛苦”，什么是“开心”？什么是红能够分辨的，什么是红能够做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"问题很多，也很难。红想不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“痛苦”？“开心”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是外婆没有照顾好红，反而需要红来救助......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，如果你不开心，就继续留在罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外婆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆的时间本来也已经不多了。就这样忘记外婆，忘记自己是个猎狼人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红睁开了眼睛。\n门和窗都还紧紧地关着，明明连一丝风都没有透进来。\n这是她今晚第三次被同样的梦惊醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆需要红......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（用力摇摇耳朵）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红答应凯尔希，离开罗德岛，要跟她说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希不在，凯尔希去了特什么蒙，很远的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红应该等——红不能等，外婆不能等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（警惕地嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红闻到了狼的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的真狼已经不多，剩下的真狼就在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"对那些狼来说，伤害外婆只是“游戏”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"那对红来说，游戏的规则便是杀死他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......外婆还在等红。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g1_newvolsiniistreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    3:17 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂欢节路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“为了非凡的夜晚，我要磨快利爪！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂欢节路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1556_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“为了迅捷的狩猎，我要亮出尖牙！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂欢节路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“为了自由的狂欢，我要拼命厮杀！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂欢节路人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1556_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“厮杀直至最后一个，游戏尽头才能到达！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂欢节路人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1557_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“究竟我们为何如此？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狂欢节路人A＆B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1556_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“因为我们是狼！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"戏一般，但在街头演出的形式值得鼓励！你瞧瞧这探照灯，瞧瞧这装饰，听听这音乐......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是大帝？你怎么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也回来了吗，小狼崽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"这种热闹的派对，和我这样的天才艺术家刚好相配！我当然要出现在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"看看，年轻人的派对比你们像样多了，阿涅塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是来参加派对的，还是来找阿涅塞的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你的阿涅塞教了你这么多，就愣是没介绍过，派对正是见老朋友的好地方吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是大帝♪眼睛超灵敏♪朋友走遍地♪......一个不注意就要把你击毙♪这歌词怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你随便唱出来的吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"即兴，即兴不就是这样吗！阿涅塞，你是不是没教过你的小朋友什么叫流行音乐啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许你说她！阿涅塞很好，她教我的歌比你唱的好听！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？她还教了你什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞教我的可多了！她教我生火教我找过夜的地方，教我怎么拿弓怎么用刀子，教我怎么狩猎怎么放干猎物的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么总是这种打打杀杀的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她还教我风的方向、花的味道，教我怎么和牙兽说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还教我怎么和人类对话，教我怎么在人类之间活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出来，你口齿还挺利索，不像那个红色的家伙，每说半句话就能把人急死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞还教我人类的狂欢节有多好玩，教我怎么在城市里也能过得开心自在，像在荒野里一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还真是学到了不少东西。运气真好，其他的獠牙可学不到这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的獠牙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前还遇见过其他的狼和他们的獠牙，开口第一个字就让人抓狂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，说实话，阿涅塞，要不是真有要紧的事情，我是绝对不想再和你们这些什么“狼之主”打交道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然狼群野蛮又顽固，但这一次同族的会面，你们不能缺席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞的同族......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"“我的意愿不足以扭转整个狼群的目光......”阿涅塞，你什么意思？说好的“挣脱道路”，说好的“新的生活”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"“游戏是狼群的决议，游戏不结束，狼群的意志就不会投向别处，这是我们的天性......”怎么又扯到你们那无聊的游戏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"“扭转天性是漫长的过程......”，真是够麻烦的！真不想跟你们打交道，一说到正经事就开始扯什么天性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞说过，“这场游戏，必须有个赢家。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"真是蠢狼，我白夸你一通了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......你教了这孩子这么多厮杀之外的本领，难道还希望她和其他獠牙一样厮杀到死？当初让我送她去罗德岛，也不是为了今天吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是担心她的安危，还是赶紧把她送回罗德岛去吧。真是的，怎么就非要到处乱跑呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"——哇！这些牙兽什么时候出现的，龇着大牙想要吓唬谁呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它们很害怕，它们嗅到了獠牙的气息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也嗅到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼已经来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g9_truckcamp"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    4:05 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，你拿冰过的盐汽水冰我的脸干嘛，吓我一跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听柳德米拉讲故事听得太入迷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个塔露拉，后来弑君者杀掉她了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。弑君者没有杀她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，明明一直跟在塔露拉身边，却始终没有察觉所谓的领袖其实是一条满嘴谎话的恶龙......本来那么多人都可以得救的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说，那个弑君者既没杀塔露拉，也没杀乌萨斯皇帝，为什么给自己取名字叫“弑君者”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得轻巧，那是皇帝和恶龙啊，你杀过人吗罗米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你不会真的杀过人吧？在给波吉亚家族干活的时候，你不会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没干过这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一个司机，也就帮那些人开开夜车。杀人越货这种事，是不会轻易交给我这样的人去做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的，你车开得这么烂，能给大人物们开夜车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开夜车......不会是什么我不知道的家族黑话吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然只是字面意思而已！你这家伙，口气怎么和警察一模一样！再说，那都是过去的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过说实在的，罗米，你最近吃的罚单是有点多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂欢节嘛，人多车多，大街小巷都不太好走，你又不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又没在满是废墟的移动城市里一边开车一边躲天灾过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还沉浸在柳德米拉的故事里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说，柳德米拉，这些故事真的只是你在乌萨斯的时候听来的吗？你讲得有鼻子有眼的，好像亲身经历过一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们啊，喝人家的汽水，听人家的故事，还缠着人家问东问西，有没有点礼貌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，怪我怪我。不好意思啊，柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，也没必要每周都是你请客吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来营地多长时间了，三个月，四个月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记不清了，反正挺久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"互助会给你发的工资，你又全还给我们这些人了。为什么不听我的，省下来将来做点小买卖呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都拖家带口的，我一个人，没什么用钱的地方。再说，我一个倒霉蛋，钱说不定存着存着也就长翅膀飞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话不是这么说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，只是两箱盐汽水而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大周末的，本来应该请大家喝点啤酒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你们今天晚上不是还要跟着去法院广场拍电影嘛，有的忙呢，只能换成口感差不多的汽水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没喝过瘾的话就多喝几瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我多来两瓶——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给你，你自己买的自己不喝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，柳德米拉还没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看看你，这都拿了多少瓶了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，不好意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我就算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，大家伙都知道的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不是说完全不在意。说实话，我摘下你的面罩时......真的吓了一跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过你是感染者，你只会比我们更在意会不会影响到别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也别怪罗米他们几个老是缠着你问东问西的，他们没恶意，就是想多了解你一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别把我们当外人，柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕阳染红了营地的草坪，以及司机们的脸。索默尔靠在后车厢，向她伸出手，其他的司机也都看着她，脸上带着毫无戒备的微笑。\n可能是盐汽水也醉人吧，眉头深锁的瑞柏巴这样想。\n短暂的沉默后，她摘下面罩，接过了那瓶盐汽水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，时间也差不多了，收拾一下，开车去法院广场吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮千叮咛万嘱咐，片场的时间安排比咱们出车排班更严格，千万不能迟到，给市政厅添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是去找拉维妮娅法官谈新司机资质审核的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了索默尔，你真不跟我们一起吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是开着卡车配合他们搞点大场面就行，很简单的，而且市政厅给的报酬可比咱们开一天车要高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我最近出车太多了，难得空下来，就在营地补觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1561_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有点事，也不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡车司机A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1550_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。那我们走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，总算......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一队队的卡车已经从营地开走，夜色慢慢降下来了，四下无人，索默尔找到了自己的车。\n他发动了车子，可还没来得及关紧车门，一个身影就已经坐在了副驾驶座上，甚至连安全带都已经系好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳、柳德米拉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是要睡觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开夜车，副驾驶座上怎么能没人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，我其实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你说的吗——别把我当外人，索默尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["红"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["柳德米拉"]}]}
